{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>לא עדה</b> — [This is] a transposed form of עדה [which] shifted among these [two] root letters, like: מעדה בגד ביום קרה."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {0 "The verse word is לא־עדה; Ibn Ezra parses it as a transposed form of the root עדה, citing Isaiah 28:21. I render עבר תרגום as referring to transposition (metathesis) of root letters."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:50.622221508Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}